<TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">(a)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">This Agreement has been duly and validly authorized, executed and delivered and is a valid and
binding contract of the General Partner and the Fund enforceable in accordance with its terms.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

